id: pm-643e0k
title: Detect extension-host pm-cli version skew before a workspace reports healthy
description: "GH-1003 proves a project can contain a pinned host @unbrained/pm-cli plus a newer nested extension copy while pm health reports ok. Add an SDK-owned dependency-resolution census and health finding that names privacy-safe package paths and versions whenever an active extension resolves a different host copy, with npm and pnpm layouts covered."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:sdk",dependency-integrity,extensions,health
created_at: "2026-08-13T22:03:33.719Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-13T22:03:33.719Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: pm health reports every distinct resolvable @unbrained/pm-cli copy relevant to an installed extension; a host/extension version mismatch cannot return a clean extensions check; clean deduplicated and workspace-linked installs stay green; npm and pnpm nested layouts have temporary-project acceptance coverage; GH-1003 is linked in evidence
parent: pm-usfg
risk: high
confidence: high
